cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these results or this method, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "AI Pre-Call Brief Benchmark: Clay vs two data providers"
abstract: "One task from a seven-task pre-registered agent study: an AI agent writes 50 pre-call research briefs on Clay and on two anonymized competitors through each platform's own tools, and a blind AI reviewer with web search scores a sample for accuracy, specificity, usefulness and fabricated facts. Not independently reviewed; one run per platform."
authors:
